<title>UK: POLL-Robert Fleming tops SE Asia research-Extel.</title>
<headline>POLL-Robert Fleming tops SE Asia research-Extel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming Securities is the top South East Asia research house, according to the 1997 Extel survey of investment analysts, weighted by size of funds mangaged by the firms which voted for them.</p>
<p>Rankings</p>
<p>1. Robert Fleming Securities</p>
<p>2. H.G. Asia</p>
<p>3. SBC Warburg</p>
<p>4. ING Barings</p>
<p>5. Deutsche Morgan Grenfell</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 2734</p>
</text>
